<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_11> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_3_subsec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_11" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يحدد اختصاص المحكمة في قانون الإجراءات المدنية و قانون الإجراءات الجزائية والقوانين الخاصة المعمول بها."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_11> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_11_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_11_20050717_OpEnact_36a243588e> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "11" ;
    dzdoc:position 10 ;
    dzdoc:referencesExternal <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_11_extref_6aeff204>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_11_extref_8d9b9552> ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:jurisdiction .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_12> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_3_subsec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_12" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "تتشكل المحكمة من : رئيس المحكمة، نائب رئيس المحكمة قضاة، قاضي التحقيق أو أكثر، قاضي الأحداث أو أكثر، وكيل الجمهورية ووكلاء جمهورية مساعدين، أمانة الضبط."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_12> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_12_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_12_20050717_OpEnact_2ed7a7f829> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "12" ;
    dzdoc:position 11 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:court .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_14> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_3_subsec_2> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_14" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يرأس أقسام المحكمة قضاة حسب تخصصاتهم."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_14> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_14_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_14_20050717_OpEnact_9b2271951a> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "14" ;
    dzdoc:position 13 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:court .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_15> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_3_subsec_2> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_15" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "تفصل المحكمة بقاض فرد، ما لم ينص القانون على خلاف ذلك."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_15> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_15_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_15_20050717_OpEnact_049cc34777> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "15" ;
    dzdoc:position 14 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:court .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_19> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_4_subsec_2> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_19" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "تحدد القواعد المتعلقة باختصاص المحاكم العسكرية وتنظيمها وسيرها بموجب قانون القضاء العسكري ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_19> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_19_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_19_20050717_OpEnact_5079d2f293> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 19" ;
    dzdoc:position 18 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:military_courts,
        dzterm:military_justice_law .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_2> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_2" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يشمل التنظيم القضائي النظام القضائي العادي و النظام القضائي الإداري و محكمة التنازع ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_2> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_2_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_2_20050717_OpEnact_935c9bd502> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "2" ;
    dzdoc:position 1 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:administrative_judicial_system,
        dzterm:conflict_court,
        dzterm:judicial_organization,
        dzterm:ordinary_judicial_system .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_3> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_3" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يشمل النظام القضائي العادي المحكمة العليا و المجالس القضائية و المحاكم ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_3> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_3_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_3_20050717_OpEnact_ff12abc229> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "3" ;
    dzdoc:position 2 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:courts,
        dzterm:judicial_councils,
        dzterm:ordinary_judicial_system,
        dzterm:supreme_court .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_4> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_4" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يشمل النظام القضائي الإداري مجلس الدولة و المحاكم الإدارية ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_4> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_4_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_4_20050717_OpEnact_075732cd13> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "4" ;
    dzdoc:position 3 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:administrative_courts,
        dzterm:administrative_judicial_system,
        dzterm:council_of_state .

<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_7> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#sec_2_subsec_1> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_7" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يتشكل المجلس القضائي من : رئيس مجلس، نائب رئيس أو أكثر، رؤساء غرف، مستشارين، نائب عام ونواب عامين مساعدين، أمانة الضبط."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_7> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#art_7_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11#version_art_7_20050717_OpEnact_4ae049a0da> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2005-07-17/05-11> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2005-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 7" ;
    dzdoc:position 6 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:مجلس_قضائي .

